    "{\"kind\":\"decision\",\"origin\":\"self-reported\",\"at\":\"2026-09-01T01:44:32.841Z\",\"choice\":\"Ship all three stages (bundle, report, Action/init/doctor) as one change\",\"rationale\":\"User decision, asked explicitly at Stage 3 after architecture-reviewer recommended cutting A+B from C and the proposal itself flagged that it exceeds the split threshold. The reviewer argument (a bundle format frozen before its renderer exists is wrong, and Stage C collides with add-maintainer-card) was put to the user with the recommendation to cut; the user chose whole.\",\"resolves\":\"Size estimate\",\"departed_from\":\"architecture-reviewer recommendation to ship Stage A+B and defer Stage C\",\"id\":\"dec:28c677de4107431d\"}",
